L1 Knowledge Base - Issue 2 (Missing Shortcuts)
v 1.0, 07/08/2026, status : Draft

Issue
Desktop shortcuts are missing after sign-in on Floor 6.

Reassurance
Your files are still safe. This is usually a shortcut display or placement issue, not file loss.

What you can safely do
1. Wait 1 to 2 minutes after sign-in for desktop loading.
2. Use Start search to find the app by name.
3. Restart your computer once.
4. Sign in again and re-check desktop shortcuts.
5. Contact the Service Desk if still missing.

Details to provide in the ticket
- Full name
- Team and floor/location
- Computer name (if known)
- Exact time issue started
- Which shortcuts are missing
- Whether app search found the app
- Whether restart was tried
- Screenshot/photo (if possible)

Contact the service desk if...
Shortcuts are still missing after one restart, or missing shortcuts block your work.
